{"id":"atom-audience-first","claim":"选题先从目标用户的观看动机与具体需求出发，再匹配创作者已有资源。","kind":"heuristic","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-content-product","claim":"把内容当作产品，同时检查用户、创作者资源、平台环境和内容目标。","kind":"heuristic","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-user-needs","claim":"用户需求可用好奇、认同、得到，以及审美、共鸣、成长、猎奇、情绪、解决问题两层框架表达。","kind":"taxonomy","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-content-mission","claim":"内容使命分为流量、涨粉、转化、调性和表达；同一条内容不必同时完成全部使命。","kind":"taxonomy","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-topic-check","claim":"候选选题至少检查热点、痛点、利益点以及实用价值或情绪价值。","kind":"procedure","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-emotional-memory","claim":"共同经历、身份或文化经验形成的情感记忆可作为共鸣强度判断维度，但不能保证流量。","kind":"heuristic","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-series-continuity","claim":"系列通过人物世界观、成长目标、挑战、数字或未完成叙事建立后续期待。","kind":"procedure","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-opening-variants","claim":"同一主题应同时提供直接价值、好奇、反常识、矛盾、身份代入等多种开头，交由用户选择或测试。","kind":"project-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-promise-fulfillment","claim":"标题与开头承诺的价值必须在正文中兑现，避免空悬念。","kind":"quality-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-visual-text-complement","claim":"画面已经清楚表达的信息不应由口播机械重复，文字应补充事实、感受或解释。","kind":"quality-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-vlog-three-needs","claim":"VLOG可从好奇、陪伴、造梦三类需求确定叙事价值。","kind":"taxonomy","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-vlog-three-checks","claim":"VLOG场景检查真实、反差和交互，普通日常仍需要明确主线。","kind":"quality-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-readable-copy","claim":"短视频文案应口语化、易理解，并允许用户短暂走神后重新进入。","kind":"quality-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-edit-story-first","claim":"粗剪先解决故事主线、信息完整性和素材取舍，再处理视觉包装。","kind":"procedure","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-search-intent","claim":"搜索流量内容应围绕明确需求组织大词、中词和具体需求词，并自然布局到标题、封面、正文和标签。","kind":"procedure","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-single-post-caution","claim":"单条数据不好不足以否定账号方向，应先区分选题、包装、开头、结构和用户错配。","kind":"project-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-observation-window","claim":"在合理场景下，新内容先保留三至七天观察，再结合平台后台数据决定调整。","kind":"heuristic","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-no-guessed-data","claim":"截图或CSV缺少字段时必须标记缺口，不补猜数字、不混用不同口径。","kind":"project-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
{"id":"atom-asset-evidence","claim":"内容资产必须记录来源、适用平台、人群、结果证据和使用限制，区分已验证资产与待验证假设。","kind":"project-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a","creator-methods-collection-b"]}
{"id":"atom-ai-user-directed","claim":"AI可根据用户要求参与头脑风暴、初稿、终稿或完整交付，不限制在固定阶段。","kind":"project-rule","source_ids":["creator-methods-collection-a"]}
